### Update Book by ID
PUT {{base_url}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
    "title": "Updated Book Title",
    "description": "This is an updated description for the book",
    "author_id": 1,
    "publication_date": "2024-01-15",
    "isbn": "978-1234567890"
}
